{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `chosen_action`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: moved the parameter prior before any model-block use of `beta` by inlining the deterministic `logits = beta * utility` expression in the observation statement. This preserves the same log density while satisfying SafeStan's requirement that each parameter be sampled from its prior before use. No data changes were required.
","model_safe_stan":"// ForestDB translation: Tug of War
data {
  int<lower=1> A;
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=A> chosen_action;
  vector[A] utility;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> beta;
}
model {
  beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75);
  chosen_action ~ categorical_logit(beta * utility);
}
generated quantities {
  simplex[A] action_prob = softmax(beta * utility);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"A":1,"N":4,"chosen_action":[1,1,1,1],"utility":[5.762319912573442]}","protected_variables":["chosen_action"]}
